WEBVTT

01:40.300 --> 01:44.200
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.039 --> 01:47.280
[Episode 34]

01:50.680 --> 01:51.479
Look.

01:52.070 --> 01:53.950
I've suppressed Mr. Loong too.

01:57.870 --> 01:59.870
Only we are left.

02:00.640 --> 02:02.510
If you still regard me as your sister,

02:03.640 --> 02:05.350
give me your Divine Hand.

02:06.310 --> 02:07.560
I have the Divine Hand.

02:07.560 --> 02:08.710
Where is Taihe?

02:08.870 --> 02:10.590
You saw him already.

02:10.870 --> 02:12.080
Don't try to fool me.

02:12.960 --> 02:13.930
The Divine Left Hand

02:13.950 --> 02:15.230
doesn't sense him at all.

02:25.470 --> 02:26.630
We had a sisterly bond.

02:26.630 --> 02:27.400
I treasure our

02:27.430 --> 02:28.960
thousand-year relationship.

02:29.270 --> 02:30.820
So, no matter what I did these years,

02:30.840 --> 02:32.680
I held back a bit for you.

02:33.590 --> 02:35.120
You know it very well.

02:35.470 --> 02:36.710
If I'd wanted to hurt you,

02:36.829 --> 02:38.150
you wouldn't be alive now.

02:38.250 --> 02:39.850
Is Taihe the demon or not?

02:41.120 --> 02:42.470
Where is his divine body?

02:42.560 --> 02:44.310
You always like to help others.

02:44.310 --> 02:45.520
Please help me this time.

02:45.520 --> 02:46.590
Give me the Divine Hand

02:46.590 --> 02:47.430
and I'll listen to

02:47.430 --> 02:48.310
whatever you say in the future.

02:48.310 --> 02:49.630
If he is really the demon,

02:49.710 --> 02:50.710
then what happened during

02:50.710 --> 02:51.840
the war between gods and demons?

02:52.030 --> 02:53.000
Only the Divine Hand,

02:53.000 --> 02:54.560
only you, can help me.

02:54.560 --> 02:56.030
You love Taihe so much.

02:56.870 --> 02:58.140
If he really died,

02:58.280 --> 02:59.150
you wouldn't just obsessed with

02:59.150 --> 03:00.470
getting this Divine Hand.

03:00.840 --> 03:02.770
So he's alive.

03:02.800 --> 03:03.960
The demon is still alive.

03:04.190 --> 03:05.910
You want to use this Divine Hand

03:06.680 --> 03:08.240
to revive the demonized Taihe,

03:08.240 --> 03:09.000
right?

03:09.690 --> 03:11.280
Do you have to do this?

03:11.680 --> 03:12.560
Tell me.

03:13.470 --> 03:14.280
Fine.

03:16.360 --> 03:17.800
You want to know?

03:18.400 --> 03:19.800
Give me your Divine Hand in exchange.

03:28.840 --> 03:30.280
If you don't tell me,

03:31.190 --> 03:32.360
I'll destroy it.

03:32.560 --> 03:34.280
Don't be silly.

03:34.400 --> 03:36.800
You lost your divine bone and have no divine power.

03:36.960 --> 03:38.030
You can't destroy it.

03:45.750 --> 03:47.680
I made this divine artifact myself.

03:47.850 --> 03:49.180
Even if I'm a mortal,

03:50.150 --> 03:51.840
I can still destroy it.

03:52.520 --> 03:54.079
Do you want to give it a try?

03:58.840 --> 03:59.630
Okay.

04:00.480 --> 04:02.320
I can tell you.

04:03.360 --> 04:04.680
But let me correct you.

04:04.780 --> 04:06.650
I've never loved Taihe.

04:07.310 --> 04:09.120
Love is either torturing yourself

04:09.120 --> 04:10.470
or torturing others.

04:10.620 --> 04:11.620
I don't need it.

04:12.360 --> 04:14.190
You've just tasted love.

04:15.080 --> 04:17.070
You should know better than me.

04:25.460 --> 04:26.260
Tell me.

04:27.390 --> 04:29.270
It's a long story.

04:35.070 --> 04:36.100
You know a bit

04:36.120 --> 04:37.409
about my past.

04:38.750 --> 04:40.080
Do you remember Chu?

04:41.490 --> 04:43.159
Your little sister in the mortal realm?

04:43.720 --> 04:44.870
Just like you,

04:45.360 --> 04:46.810
she was my lovely little sister.

04:49.830 --> 04:52.480
I doted on her, cared for her, and loved her.

04:54.800 --> 04:56.770
In order to give her a good life,

04:57.430 --> 04:59.600
I embroidered day and night to earn money.

05:00.680 --> 05:02.510
I just wished I could earn enough

05:02.510 --> 05:04.480
to cover all her expenses for the rest of her life.

05:05.720 --> 05:07.000
When I was about to be burned

05:07.000 --> 05:08.190
to death

05:08.190 --> 05:09.600
and wronged by everyone,

05:10.040 --> 05:11.360
the one I worried about the most

05:12.200 --> 05:13.440
was still her.

05:15.310 --> 05:16.800
You once told me

05:17.070 --> 05:18.600
I look like Chu,

05:19.160 --> 05:20.040
so you treated me

05:20.040 --> 05:21.120
as your sister.

05:21.310 --> 05:22.120
For this,

05:22.310 --> 05:23.560
I'm grateful

05:24.040 --> 05:25.270
and respect you.

05:27.480 --> 05:29.070
Actually, I didn't tell you

05:29.600 --> 05:31.190
that I went to the mortal realm secretly.

05:32.000 --> 05:33.680
I found that the person who framed me

05:34.390 --> 05:36.310
was my sister Chu.

05:37.070 --> 05:37.920
I stopped her

05:37.920 --> 05:39.510
from marrying that loser,

05:40.040 --> 05:41.630
so she wanted to kill me.

05:47.000 --> 05:47.800
Chu.

05:48.390 --> 05:49.480
I won’t allow you to go.

05:49.830 --> 05:51.310
I forbid you from seeing him again.

05:51.510 --> 05:52.830
He idles away his days without learning anything

05:52.830 --> 05:53.870
and gambles every day.

05:53.950 --> 05:55.480
He's not a good match for you.

05:56.390 --> 05:57.560
He may not be good,

05:57.750 --> 05:59.390
but his family is rich.

05:59.800 --> 06:02.070
Hannv, if I marry him,

06:02.070 --> 06:02.720
I won't have to

06:02.720 --> 06:03.950
suffer anymore.

06:04.510 --> 06:05.430
Don't worry.

06:05.510 --> 06:07.310
I'll take more embroidery work.

06:07.390 --> 06:09.270
I'll earn enough for your dowry as soon as possible.

06:12.360 --> 06:13.160
Embroidery...

06:13.160 --> 06:14.310
All you talk about is embroidery.

06:14.310 --> 06:15.040
What else can you do

06:15.040 --> 06:16.190
besides embroidery?

06:16.230 --> 06:17.310
These rubbish!

06:17.480 --> 06:18.270
Chu.

06:18.600 --> 06:19.360
When can I

06:19.360 --> 06:20.070
live a good life?

06:20.070 --> 06:21.830
-How can I work if you do this?
-I just want to go see him.

06:21.830 --> 06:22.560
Chu.

06:24.790 --> 06:26.840
I still remember that fire.

06:29.040 --> 06:30.800
It burned so fiercely.

06:33.360 --> 06:34.600
I didn't seduce a man.

06:34.600 --> 06:35.800
I was wronged.

06:36.159 --> 06:37.159
I didn't!

06:37.310 --> 06:38.510
I didn't seduce a man.

06:38.680 --> 06:40.040
I'm innocent!

06:40.480 --> 06:41.120
Burn her to death!

06:41.120 --> 06:41.950
I really didn't.

06:42.000 --> 06:43.070
I really didn't.

06:43.070 --> 06:43.920
Burn her!

06:44.310 --> 06:45.720
I really didn't.

06:46.040 --> 06:47.560
I didn't seduce a man.

06:47.560 --> 06:49.000
I'm innocent!

06:52.390 --> 06:54.390
I was wronged.

07:15.190 --> 07:16.270
It hurt so much.

07:16.830 --> 07:18.240
But the pain caused by Chu's betrayal

07:18.240 --> 07:19.430
hurt thousands,

07:19.950 --> 07:20.750
tens of thousands of times more,

07:20.750 --> 07:22.750
than the fire.

07:27.870 --> 07:29.600
I still don't understand.

07:30.240 --> 07:31.560
I treated her so well.

07:32.310 --> 07:33.720
Why did she do that?

07:36.120 --> 07:37.430
Do you understand?

07:38.560 --> 07:39.920
So you took revenge on her?

07:40.390 --> 07:41.190
Yes.

07:42.040 --> 07:43.630
If it were me,

07:43.630 --> 07:45.630
I wouldn't have let them off.

07:46.000 --> 07:47.560
Taihe stopped you.

07:48.940 --> 07:49.600
Yes.

07:50.040 --> 07:51.159
He told me,

07:51.630 --> 07:52.720
"When virtue resides within,

07:52.740 --> 07:54.500
one steadfastly cherishes oneself.

07:54.630 --> 07:55.800
When vice resides within,

07:55.800 --> 07:57.560
one inevitably despises oneself."

07:57.750 --> 07:58.800
He also said

07:59.270 --> 08:00.800
that everyone makes mistakes.

08:01.040 --> 08:03.560
Being able to amend wrongs is the biggest virtue.

08:03.750 --> 08:05.380
Be kind to the kind

08:05.430 --> 08:07.430
and also to the unkind. That is true virtue.

08:07.600 --> 08:09.040
To feel shame from wrongdoings,

08:09.040 --> 08:10.310
a virtuous heart will arise.

08:10.310 --> 08:11.390
To forgive others' mistakes

08:11.390 --> 08:13.070
is one's own glory.

08:13.680 --> 08:15.200
I memorized it well, right?

08:15.510 --> 08:17.060
Because what he said made sense.

08:17.090 --> 08:18.310
I was convinced by him.

08:18.830 --> 08:20.560
I was willing to let go of my hatred

08:20.800 --> 08:22.560
and cultivate with him.

08:51.390 --> 08:52.720
At that time,

08:53.080 --> 08:54.670
I thought I was so lucky.

08:55.150 --> 08:56.630
I was a mere goddess,

08:57.150 --> 08:58.480
but I was saved by Taihe,

08:58.480 --> 09:00.630
the powerful Primordial God.

09:01.320 --> 09:03.080
If he hadn't stop me in time,

09:03.080 --> 09:04.720
I would have killed to vent my anger,

09:04.720 --> 09:06.670
ruined my spiritual heart and fallen into demonic ways.

09:07.000 --> 09:08.910
I wouldn't have been able to remain a god.

09:09.670 --> 09:10.720
He told me

09:11.200 --> 09:12.480
human nature is good.

09:12.890 --> 09:14.840
Everyone makes mistakes.

09:15.600 --> 09:18.000
Chu would definitely repent.

09:18.290 --> 09:19.250
Just like that,

09:19.670 --> 09:21.200
decades more went by.

09:39.320 --> 09:40.120
Chu.

09:41.630 --> 09:42.320
Ghost!

09:42.550 --> 09:43.340
Ghost!

09:43.600 --> 09:44.390
Ghost!

09:44.670 --> 09:45.910
Ghost!

09:46.200 --> 09:47.000
Ghost!

09:47.440 --> 09:48.240
Ghost!

09:49.360 --> 09:50.980
She thought I was a vengeful spirit

09:51.510 --> 09:53.220
coming to take revenge on her.

09:54.000 --> 09:55.450
She was the one who killed me,

09:55.630 --> 09:57.750
but she had no remorse at all.

09:58.030 --> 09:59.790
She blamed me for everything

09:59.790 --> 10:01.000
and cursed me to never be free

10:01.000 --> 10:02.070
of resentment.

10:02.600 --> 10:04.050
Wasn't she vicious?

10:04.750 --> 10:06.080
Why did she do this to me?

10:11.840 --> 10:13.750
But she died just like that.

10:15.020 --> 10:16.440
I thought those who were unkind

10:16.440 --> 10:18.000
would suffer the consequences.

10:18.440 --> 10:19.550
I thought those who fixed their mistakes

10:19.550 --> 10:20.910
would have virtue.

10:22.000 --> 10:22.670
No.

10:23.250 --> 10:24.290
None of that happened.

10:24.840 --> 10:26.080
I didn't want forgiveness

10:26.080 --> 10:27.080
nor glory.

10:27.080 --> 10:28.270
I just wanted revenge.

10:28.670 --> 10:30.270
But she died like this.

10:30.600 --> 10:32.090
I could never see her again.

10:33.670 --> 10:35.030
What about my hatred?

10:36.000 --> 10:37.510
What should I do with my hatred?

10:50.870 --> 10:52.720
Everything has been handled?

10:53.750 --> 10:54.630
Yes.

10:56.480 --> 10:57.270
That's good.

11:10.530 --> 11:12.560
So you didn't let go of the hatred.

11:13.840 --> 11:15.000
Why should I?

11:15.750 --> 11:17.150
How could I?

11:17.550 --> 11:18.930
He said those principles

11:18.960 --> 11:19.790
and he made sense.

11:19.790 --> 11:20.960
I believed him too.

11:21.000 --> 11:21.720
But Chu

11:21.720 --> 11:23.480
didn't repent as he said.

11:23.960 --> 11:24.870
They say that gods

11:24.870 --> 11:26.270
all live freely and comfortably.

11:26.510 --> 11:28.490
I'm neither carefree nor comfortable.

11:29.030 --> 11:30.850
I'd rather have become a vengeful ghost

11:31.200 --> 11:32.870
and ended this hatred long ago.

11:34.080 --> 11:35.870
Becoming a god, I must suppress myself

11:36.240 --> 11:37.600
and have selfless love.

11:38.000 --> 11:39.270
What's the point of being a god?

11:39.320 --> 11:40.120
Why?

11:41.000 --> 11:41.790
So...

11:42.120 --> 11:43.560
you started to hate Taihe?

11:43.790 --> 11:44.600
Yes.

11:45.200 --> 11:46.440
I hated him.

11:46.720 --> 11:48.270
I hated him for being righteous,

11:48.270 --> 11:49.360
pretentious,

11:49.360 --> 11:50.640
and full of benevolence and morality.

11:51.390 --> 11:53.240
But what could I do?

11:54.120 --> 11:55.460
He was too strong.

11:56.270 --> 11:58.000
I could only bury

11:58.880 --> 12:00.280
all this hatred.

12:01.150 --> 12:02.480
Until one day,

12:02.870 --> 12:04.930
I discovered a big secret.

12:05.510 --> 12:06.670
Our supreme

12:06.670 --> 12:08.000
Primordial God

12:08.440 --> 12:09.610
had anger,

12:10.030 --> 12:11.240
desires,

12:11.440 --> 12:12.630
and resentment too.

12:12.910 --> 12:13.840
That's impossible!

12:13.960 --> 12:14.720
The Primordial God

12:14.720 --> 12:16.170
has no emotions or desires.

12:18.030 --> 12:20.200
He is also of flesh and blood.

12:20.750 --> 12:23.200
He looked down upon the Three Realms for thousands of years

12:23.360 --> 12:25.240
and saw the conditions of all beings.

12:25.630 --> 12:27.510
How could he not have emotions and desires?

12:27.910 --> 12:29.360
They say the Primordial God

12:29.360 --> 12:30.960
represents the justice of heaven and earth

12:31.080 --> 12:33.360
and is absolutely fair.

12:33.790 --> 12:34.910
You believe it?

12:37.840 --> 12:39.200
He had hypocrisy,

12:39.550 --> 12:40.440
obsession,

12:40.840 --> 12:41.670
ignorance,

12:41.840 --> 12:42.720
jealousy,

12:42.750 --> 12:43.670
and cruelty.

12:44.840 --> 12:47.000
He was no different from ordinary people.

12:47.670 --> 12:48.480
But because

12:48.480 --> 12:50.080
he was the Primordial God,

12:50.270 --> 12:52.260
he could temporarily remove

12:52.290 --> 12:53.600
and suppress these desires.

12:54.150 --> 12:55.510
Over the years,

12:55.950 --> 12:57.950
the malice he suppressed

12:58.320 --> 12:59.870
grew more and more.

13:01.600 --> 13:02.360
So you

13:02.360 --> 13:03.770
released Taihe's malice?

13:03.960 --> 13:05.390
You released the Demon Lord?

13:06.140 --> 13:08.100
Yes, it was me.

13:08.720 --> 13:09.960
Why shouldn't I?

13:10.270 --> 13:12.030
If he could lecture me,

13:12.390 --> 13:14.510
then he must be very clear-minded.

13:15.390 --> 13:16.720
I wanted to see

13:17.150 --> 13:18.730
if he could continue

13:19.390 --> 13:22.080
to talk about kindness after tasting hardship.

13:23.850 --> 13:25.040
Reality shows

13:25.920 --> 13:27.610
he couldn't do it either.

13:29.200 --> 13:30.120
The war between gods and demons

13:30.120 --> 13:31.670
forced him to his wit's end.

13:32.270 --> 13:33.910
Before he died, he had to cut off his Divine Hand

13:33.910 --> 13:35.200
and break off the celestial ladder

13:35.270 --> 13:37.080
to split the demon into two,

13:37.200 --> 13:38.510
with half in the Heavenly Realm,

13:38.600 --> 13:40.270
and the other half in the Divine Hand.

13:40.580 --> 13:43.210
Although it will take some time,

13:43.790 --> 13:45.930
if they're combined into one again,

13:46.240 --> 13:49.960
he will be the new Demon Lord.

13:51.250 --> 13:53.040
So Taihe is already dead.

13:53.390 --> 13:54.510
You don't want this Divine Hand

13:54.510 --> 13:56.150
for Taihe,

13:56.150 --> 13:57.870
but to revive the Demon Lord.

13:57.990 --> 13:58.800
That's right.

13:59.870 --> 14:01.390
The world has the Five Sins.

14:01.390 --> 14:03.080
Only after the baptism of death

14:03.080 --> 14:04.840
can we return peace.

14:05.080 --> 14:06.510
Yuanzhong originally had

14:06.510 --> 14:08.010
the chance to do this,

14:08.150 --> 14:09.410
but he's too useless.

14:09.600 --> 14:10.200
For you,

14:10.200 --> 14:11.790
he gave up such a great chance.

14:12.510 --> 14:13.480
If he won't do it,

14:13.830 --> 14:14.870
then I will.

14:15.080 --> 14:16.390
You are a god worshipped

14:16.390 --> 14:17.240
by the people.

14:17.240 --> 14:18.550
I don't want to be a god!

14:18.550 --> 14:19.670
I don't want to forgive

14:19.670 --> 14:21.000
anyone again!

14:21.080 --> 14:23.240
It's your turn to forgive me now.

14:23.270 --> 14:24.790
I won't let you succeed!

14:30.390 --> 14:31.190
In your dreams!

15:09.910 --> 15:10.720
Drought Dragon!

15:37.180 --> 15:38.060
Kill her.

15:38.750 --> 15:39.790
Do it now.

15:55.600 --> 15:57.720
This is the Heavenly Furnace I embroidered.

15:57.960 --> 15:59.200
With the heaven and earth as the furnace,

15:59.200 --> 16:00.390
fortune as the method,

16:00.600 --> 16:01.750
and yin and yang as the charcoal,

16:01.870 --> 16:03.150
it can refine everything.

16:03.720 --> 16:05.200
Enjoy it.

18:44.500 --> 18:45.350
Tanghua.

19:20.680 --> 19:21.480
Tanghua.

19:22.680 --> 19:23.480
Tanghua!

20:14.550 --> 20:15.550
Where is Yuanzhong?

20:15.750 --> 20:17.070
Tell him to come out and die.

20:17.400 --> 20:18.720
He's already dead.

20:20.200 --> 20:21.110
I don't believe it.

20:36.000 --> 20:37.110
Your wish has come true.

20:42.160 --> 20:43.550
Even if he's dead,

20:44.000 --> 20:45.750
I want to chop his body into pieces.

20:45.790 --> 20:46.680
In your dreams!

22:01.840 --> 22:02.640
Qian Lin.

22:18.920 --> 22:19.720
Qian Lin!

22:20.480 --> 22:21.270
Qian Lin.

22:21.480 --> 22:22.410
Are you alright?

22:47.300 --> 22:48.700
Greetings, Goddess.

23:06.240 --> 23:07.310
Goddess of Embroidery.

23:22.070 --> 23:22.880
Stop!

23:29.160 --> 23:30.000
How are you?

23:30.760 --> 23:31.390
Here.

23:40.680 --> 23:43.070
The demon has been hiding in the Divine Hand for many years

23:43.480 --> 23:44.960
and finally chose Yuanzhong

23:44.960 --> 23:46.160
as the host.

23:46.750 --> 23:48.450
It wanted to use his body

23:48.480 --> 23:50.240
to absorb the mortal realm's malice,

23:50.790 --> 23:52.650
but he was such a disappointment.

23:53.510 --> 23:54.350
He suffered so many

23:54.350 --> 23:55.750
grievances and hardships,

23:55.830 --> 23:57.550
and he wanted revenge,

23:57.740 --> 23:59.980
but he always stopped at the last moment.

24:00.920 --> 24:02.710
I really don't understand.

24:03.550 --> 24:04.310
He had

24:04.310 --> 24:05.720
so much power.

24:05.900 --> 24:07.450
How could he hold it in?

24:08.720 --> 24:10.240
Fortunately,

24:10.730 --> 24:12.090
he fell in love with you

24:12.640 --> 24:14.400
and eventually died because of you.

24:15.640 --> 24:17.130
Now his body

24:17.150 --> 24:18.940
is the best hotbed for the demon.

24:19.750 --> 24:23.160
The demon will resurrect in his body.

24:57.640 --> 24:58.440
Yuanzhong?

24:59.000 --> 25:00.280
He's not Yuanzhong.

25:57.370 --> 25:59.760
I, Li Chaoyang, Chief of the War Demons,

26:00.880 --> 26:02.270
welcome the Demon Lord.

26:09.690 --> 26:13.140
The War Demon Clan is willing to die for you.

26:36.960 --> 26:38.440
You still know to come?

26:39.000 --> 26:40.440
You all work for the heavens.

26:40.440 --> 26:41.920
Learn from the tribulations.

26:42.110 --> 26:43.790
Every now and then, regardless of day or night,

26:43.790 --> 26:44.860
it comes whenever it wants.

26:45.480 --> 26:46.400
Now,

26:46.400 --> 26:47.350
every time I see gray clouds,

26:47.350 --> 26:48.480
my heart starts pounding.

26:52.480 --> 26:53.640
Hey, I'm just speaking from my heart.

26:53.640 --> 26:54.920
Why are you mad?

26:55.510 --> 26:56.440
Since you're here,

26:56.520 --> 26:57.370
give me a ride.

27:23.030 --> 27:24.510
No one is here.

27:24.880 --> 27:25.750
The Heavenly Realm

27:25.750 --> 27:28.030
is really cold and quiet.

27:37.670 --> 27:38.710
How is it?

27:41.350 --> 27:43.880
The smell of freedom is everywhere.

27:44.960 --> 27:46.310
It's sweet.

27:47.480 --> 27:49.200
I didn't work hard to release you

27:49.590 --> 27:50.480
so you can

27:50.480 --> 27:51.750
just enjoy freedom.

27:56.830 --> 27:58.920
I don't need you to remind me.

28:00.930 --> 28:02.580
I’ll wait and see.

28:14.480 --> 28:15.520
My Lord,

28:15.830 --> 28:18.200
all the War Demons have assembled.

28:18.830 --> 28:20.590
We are at your disposal.

28:22.880 --> 28:26.030
Who is the strongest in the Mortal Realm?

28:26.750 --> 28:28.030
The Youhu Clan.

28:29.790 --> 28:30.590
Okay.

28:31.710 --> 28:33.400
Let's start from there.

28:33.520 --> 28:34.800
Yes, Demon Lord.

28:50.160 --> 28:50.960
Wushuang,

28:51.480 --> 28:52.960
don't waste your time.

28:53.240 --> 28:55.110
If it was so easy to get out,

28:55.130 --> 28:57.480
I wouldn't have been trapped for so long.

28:58.310 --> 28:59.420
In this world,

28:59.750 --> 29:01.550
there are no magical artifacts that can trap me.

29:23.400 --> 29:24.240
Is anyone there?

29:34.110 --> 29:36.880
Did I disturb you?

29:38.230 --> 29:39.230
Lord Mei Shan?

29:40.570 --> 29:41.760
Are you Ji Tanyin?

29:42.670 --> 29:43.470
It's me.

29:43.640 --> 29:44.190
Wait.

29:45.110 --> 29:46.240
Why are you here?

29:46.240 --> 29:47.200
Are all palaces in the Divine Realm

29:47.200 --> 29:48.350
so special?

29:48.350 --> 29:49.240
I'm already here.

29:49.240 --> 29:50.550
Why don't you invite me in?

29:50.590 --> 29:51.820
I'm trapped here.

29:51.960 --> 29:52.960
Work with me

29:52.960 --> 29:54.000
to break through the furnace.

29:57.400 --> 29:58.850
Step back. Leave it to me.

29:58.940 --> 29:59.660
Okay.

30:23.550 --> 30:24.610
What are you doing here?

30:24.720 --> 30:25.790
It's a long story.

30:25.790 --> 30:26.830
We'll talk about it later.

30:27.240 --> 30:27.880
Mr. Loong,

30:28.030 --> 30:29.750
go to the Discipline Hall and invite the five divine lords.

30:29.750 --> 30:30.680
I'll stop Hannv.

30:30.680 --> 30:31.310
Okay.

30:31.680 --> 30:32.470
Let's go.

30:40.310 --> 30:40.960
Report!

30:40.960 --> 30:42.070
The High Priest has led the War Demons

30:42.070 --> 30:43.070
to break through the gate.

30:43.720 --> 30:45.160
Is it really the High Priest?

30:45.270 --> 30:45.890
Yes.

30:46.000 --> 30:47.000
I saw him clearly.

30:47.020 --> 30:48.130
It's the High Priest.

30:51.480 --> 30:52.140
Get into position!

31:05.940 --> 31:07.350
My Lord, what are you looking at?

31:07.420 --> 31:10.480
[Hall of Elders]

31:08.170 --> 31:10.130
There's a lot of resentment here.

31:10.670 --> 31:12.190
I like it.

31:59.750 --> 32:00.880
Submit to me.

32:00.880 --> 32:01.880
You're delusional!

32:14.790 --> 32:15.880
Or die.

32:18.200 --> 32:19.310
Are you Yuanzhong

32:20.910 --> 32:22.070
or the Demon Lord?

32:22.480 --> 32:24.240
It doesn't matter who you

32:24.920 --> 32:26.200
view me as.

32:26.960 --> 32:28.110
What matters is

32:28.750 --> 32:29.880
I saw your actions

32:29.880 --> 32:31.970
in the sea of consciousness.

32:33.270 --> 32:34.590
You want to live.

32:35.390 --> 32:36.630
Nothing wrong with that.

32:37.140 --> 32:38.860
The original rule of the world

32:39.200 --> 32:41.030
was survival of the fittest.

32:44.740 --> 32:46.220
Be my disciple

32:47.160 --> 32:48.670
and I'll grant you eternal life.

32:58.350 --> 32:59.720
I'm willing to submit.

33:05.510 --> 33:06.350
That's right.

33:08.850 --> 33:09.760
What about you?

33:11.350 --> 33:12.020
I...

33:27.970 --> 33:29.250
Who else?

33:34.550 --> 33:35.750
I'm willing to submit.

33:39.200 --> 33:40.440
I'm willing to submit.

33:40.720 --> 33:41.880
I'm willing to submit.

33:42.020 --> 33:43.110
I'm willing to submit.

33:43.130 --> 33:44.070
I'm willing to submit.

33:44.070 --> 33:45.160
I'm willing to submit.

33:45.360 --> 33:46.360
I'm willing to submit.

33:52.190 --> 33:54.720
[Fragrant Grove]

34:20.550 --> 34:21.710
Yuanzhong is missing.

34:23.480 --> 34:24.280
It seems

34:25.120 --> 34:26.440
they have succeeded.

34:30.630 --> 34:31.320
Ji Tanyin!

34:31.440 --> 34:32.320
Where is Yuanzhong?

34:33.360 --> 34:34.469
Where are Tanghua and Zhi Dai?

34:34.630 --> 34:35.630
Li Chaoyang came.

34:35.800 --> 34:36.710
Tanghua was taken away.

34:36.710 --> 34:37.380
Yuanzhong...

34:38.480 --> 34:39.670
Yuanzhong was possessed.

35:15.510 --> 35:16.360
Hannv.

35:17.110 --> 35:18.960
My Lord, you look great today.

35:19.130 --> 35:20.900
It seems that the submission of the ants

35:20.920 --> 35:22.070
has made you happy.

35:24.400 --> 35:25.190
No.

35:27.590 --> 35:29.230
It's the fear of the ants

35:29.230 --> 35:30.590
that makes me happy.

35:31.480 --> 35:32.360
What's wrong?

35:33.670 --> 35:34.480
Good news.

35:34.710 --> 35:35.840
We have news of victory.

35:36.320 --> 35:37.110
It's "I."

35:38.630 --> 35:40.240
I have news of victory,

35:40.780 --> 35:42.080
not us.

35:44.320 --> 35:45.110
Yes.

35:45.690 --> 35:47.210
Your news of victory, My Lord.

35:48.590 --> 35:49.440
Tell me.

35:50.370 --> 35:52.200
Fangwai Mountain was taken successfully.

35:52.400 --> 35:54.110
The disobedient Youhu Clan members

35:54.110 --> 35:55.190
have all been detained.

35:55.190 --> 35:57.480
All clans and tribes have responded

35:57.480 --> 35:59.360
they are willing to obey your wishes

35:59.360 --> 36:00.650
and submit to you.

36:01.150 --> 36:02.670
Shortly after, they will pay tribute

36:02.670 --> 36:04.230
and send many hostage princes.

36:04.300 --> 36:06.700
Now only the Yandu City of the human race

36:06.730 --> 36:08.890
is still rebellious and fighting stubbornly,

36:09.030 --> 36:11.010
but they're already weak.

36:11.110 --> 36:12.230
Like an insect blocking a carriage,

36:12.320 --> 36:13.280
I doubt they'll have

36:13.280 --> 36:14.280
much success.

36:15.230 --> 36:16.830
This is the report of all clans that have submitted to you.

36:17.200 --> 36:18.470
My Lord, please have a look.

36:36.290 --> 36:37.970
All tribes submitted,

36:38.400 --> 36:40.030
hostage princes have been detained,

36:40.590 --> 36:42.320
and tribute has been paid.

36:44.440 --> 36:46.480
Am I going to be an emperor?

36:49.440 --> 36:51.540
Next, should I pardon the world,

36:51.560 --> 36:52.800
unify the currency,

36:52.800 --> 36:54.440
guard the frontier, launch construction projects,

36:54.470 --> 36:56.060
build temples and canals,

36:56.090 --> 36:57.170
and finally build myself

36:57.190 --> 36:58.560
a big mausoleum?

36:59.190 --> 37:00.150
I thought...

37:00.230 --> 37:01.320
You thought?

37:05.720 --> 37:07.590
What do you think I am?

37:08.150 --> 37:09.550
An ordinary spirit

37:09.760 --> 37:12.110
or a pet you're raising?

37:12.330 --> 37:14.440
D-Demon Lord...

37:20.110 --> 37:22.900
You begged me to help you overturn the world.

37:23.480 --> 37:24.960
I will do it.

37:25.780 --> 37:26.710
But

37:27.530 --> 37:29.340
it must be with my method.

37:34.780 --> 37:36.340
Why are you glaring at me?

37:37.630 --> 37:38.880
Do you want me gouge

37:38.880 --> 37:40.000
your eyes out?

37:40.820 --> 37:41.650
Hannv,

37:42.180 --> 37:43.540
remember this.

37:44.440 --> 37:45.880
Remember well

37:46.390 --> 37:47.540
that I am the master.

37:48.410 --> 37:49.610
You are the servant.

37:53.710 --> 37:55.310
I know you're not willing.

37:56.400 --> 37:57.510
You don't have to.

37:58.400 --> 38:00.150
I know you're good at acting.

38:01.110 --> 38:02.710
Continue your acting then.

38:03.710 --> 38:05.910
Act humble and obedient.

38:06.230 --> 38:08.310
Act smart and capable.

38:11.530 --> 38:13.050
I almost forgot.

38:13.440 --> 38:14.930
You can't even pretend

38:15.720 --> 38:18.190
to be smart and capable.

38:22.830 --> 38:24.320
Do you know what

38:24.320 --> 38:26.420
the biggest problem you gods have?

38:27.200 --> 38:28.880
It's being pedantic

38:29.430 --> 38:30.990
and spiritless.

38:36.000 --> 38:37.550
If I wanted to create

38:37.550 --> 38:39.920
an eternal demon nation,

38:41.110 --> 38:43.510
that would be so boring.

38:59.110 --> 39:00.550
Have the left side

39:01.050 --> 39:02.710
attack Yandu.

39:03.590 --> 39:05.150
Regardless of gender and age,

39:05.660 --> 39:07.230
kill them all.

39:07.970 --> 39:09.340
When it's done,

39:10.380 --> 39:12.050
have those on the right side

39:12.710 --> 39:14.830
ambush the ones on the left.

39:15.330 --> 39:17.600
When they are all badly hurt,

39:18.000 --> 39:20.400
you can lead the people from Fangwai Mountain

39:21.170 --> 39:23.650
to capture them all.

39:26.920 --> 39:28.070
And I will

39:29.360 --> 39:30.800
come out in the end

39:32.320 --> 39:35.800
and kill them all.

39:38.230 --> 39:39.030
Kill...

39:39.480 --> 39:40.920
Kill them all!

39:48.080 --> 39:49.440
Just kidding.

39:51.000 --> 39:51.800
You...

39:52.240 --> 39:54.190
I'll keep you because you're still useful.

40:00.030 --> 40:01.470
Anything else?

40:01.590 --> 40:02.510
Nothing.

40:04.030 --> 40:05.320
Rest assured, My Lord.

40:06.150 --> 40:07.840
After I've done what I should do,

40:08.230 --> 40:09.630
so what if I die?

40:10.480 --> 40:11.650
Go back to work.

40:12.670 --> 40:13.370
Yes.

40:51.110 --> 40:54.070
The human race of Yandu is here to await orders.

40:54.700 --> 40:56.040
Awaiting orders.

40:56.280 --> 40:57.480
Awaiting orders.

42:09.960 --> 42:11.440
What are you looking at?

42:21.710 --> 42:23.110
Your acting is so bad.

42:24.230 --> 42:25.760
I overestimated you.

42:28.800 --> 42:30.360
I had a dream.

42:32.360 --> 42:34.040
What did you dream about?

42:35.190 --> 42:37.000
He hasn't given up yet.

42:37.400 --> 42:38.190
Who?

42:39.910 --> 42:41.420
Who are you talking about?

42:48.480 --> 42:50.320
You mean the High Priest of the Youhu Clan?

42:51.550 --> 42:52.760
He's not dead yet?

42:55.000 --> 42:56.280
Not yet.

42:57.320 --> 42:59.630
He's hiding in the deepest part of the sea of consciousness,

43:00.320 --> 43:03.190
trying with his last breath to guard

43:03.190 --> 43:06.190
the remaining bits of hope and joy in life.

43:07.240 --> 43:10.030
The world's beings are so laughable.

43:11.110 --> 43:12.510
He clearly suffered

43:12.510 --> 43:14.150
so much pain,

43:14.550 --> 43:17.000
but he still refuses to embrace the darkness

43:17.000 --> 43:18.760
and refuses to submit to me.

43:21.550 --> 43:22.720
He refuses to submit?

43:27.360 --> 43:29.590
He's waiting for someone.

43:30.550 --> 43:31.590
And I

43:33.000 --> 43:34.480
am also waiting.
